WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,800
you find so much

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,480
Banjinlou has not been searched

3
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,760
There are not many things in the dormitory

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,880
There is a small building behind

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,880
like a canteen

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,480
But we probably won’t be able to move.

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,680
Already found so many supplies

8
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,560
I can't move it back at all. I'll take some of it with me first.

9
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:29,820
Come back tomorrow for the rest, okay, don't go

10
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,900
Seems like a scam

11
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:40,060
something left behind

12
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:43,470
Let you go, uncle

13
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,070
What nonsense are you talking to two little girls?

14
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,270
Take away people and things together

15
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:47,590
Our families happened to be divided

16
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:49,110
Hey hey hey
